<box.title>
Developer Out of Town!
</box.title>

<box.text>
# Hello everyone!
**DrMineword** here!
<fat1>
As you can see, I will be leaving my home for a few days.
And during this time I wont be able to fully work on Gwent!
<fat1>
Due to this, work on adding a new Faction and improving Gwent itself will be suspended (probably until this message expires).
-# Remember to join our [Discord Server](https://theredmineword.github.io/GWENT/api/discord-iframe/page) for news and updates!
</box.text>

